{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act41side_level_act41side_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act41side",
  "stageId": "act41side_02",
  "title": "不過別離",
  "storyCode": "EA-2",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "19192483914e5d086be8a6736532791864855f27b4e131c4cca011834a63fc90",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好多人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉！呃……借過一下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——米林頓街我也去過了，早就什麼也沒有了！雖然店門都開著，但貨架全是空的，連個袋子都沒有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "克拉馬那傢伙說這邊有庫存，我才跑了五條街過來——結果還是連根羽獸毛都看不見！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我還不如回去拿弩，翻出去崗哨，到黑林裡打點獵，或許還能在餓死之前吃點真正的葷腥……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我看你是餓瘋了，去黑林才是真的去送死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你沒發瘋？！說得像你就知道什麼了一樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼不知道？拉格蘭街的糧店，艾瑪開的，你知道吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那家我還沒去呢，怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我先去的那裡。雖然也沒糧食，但聽艾瑪的說法，這件事和*維多利亞粗口*的維多利亞人脫不了關係！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "維多利亞的混蛋封鎖我們，這又不是第一天了，他們當然該負責。這有什麼稀奇的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "維多利亞的間諜已經滲透進納斯爾紗了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你再說一遍？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "艾瑪去農業地塊的時候親眼看見了被火燒過的痕跡，深池還在調查呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*維多利亞粗口*！塔拉獨立之後我們就該馬上打回去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過有句話你說對了，你確實該回去拿你的弩，但不是為了打獵，而是為了找出那些幫維多利亞人辦事的叛徒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果讓我抓到他，肯定不是用弩箭穿心這麼簡單就結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小聲）好像是這些店裡的糧食供應斷了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小聲）雖然我幫庫林先生囤積了一些馬鈴薯，但可能還是不夠……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小聲）這裡人太多了，還是走另一條路吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小聲）還有好多人都拿著武器……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小聲）他們是想圍剿維多利亞間諜嗎？城裡沒有糧食……跟維多利亞人也有關係嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小聲）但我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小聲）我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我沒關係的。我是庫林先生的學徒。大家都知道這件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別害怕，提奧。大家不會拿你怎麼樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "提奧努力矮下身子，從人群中擠出去，來到街道的轉角處。他靈活地從一條狹窄暗道裡穿過，來到石磚牆體的另一面。\n嘈雜的人聲逐漸從他的耳邊退去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……你看，提奧，沒人找你的麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "庫林先生肯定還在忙紅龍雕像的事，等他反應過來，其他店裡肯定也什麼都不剩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我得幫忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們先把這些東西拿去吃，分給周圍的鄰居，讓他們不要急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你自己怎麼辦？還有涅梅絲，她會不會沒得吃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "比起把糧食都給我們，你不如跟那些人一起去抓維多利亞間諜。否則無法從根本上解決問題，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "……我會去的，也麻煩你這樣告訴其他人。\n這些東西你們也先拿著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "涅梅絲在領袖的身邊，為你們吃些苦也是應該的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我……那我就不跟你客氣了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰沉的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……庫林，你肯定還有別的存糧，對不對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰沉的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且，你怎麼知道糧食供應會中斷？是不是涅梅絲提前跟你說了什麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "羅里，你在說什麼啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不要就算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰沉的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有誰能證明你或者涅梅絲不是間諜？你們合夥養大了一個維多利亞人的孩子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……滾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰沉的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我憑什麼滾？你心虛什麼？你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "庫林，我聽說你在發糧，真是太及時了！你發的東西都在哪裡呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剩下的都在這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰沉的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別打斷我。庫林，你還沒回答我的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "能說的我都已經說了。你要是覺得這點馬鈴薯弄髒你的手，就把袋子給別人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰沉的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "羅里，你到底要不要？不要就給我，想要的人多的是，別不識好歹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "給我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰沉的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "憑什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不是不要嗎，給我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰沉的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想得美——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃——啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "袋子裡的馬鈴薯都很小，沒有一個長成正常的橢圓形。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的手臂？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天啊，流血了！羅里，你怎麼能對同胞下手？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰沉的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我、我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "把刀放下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別逼我用這把錘子對付你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不、不愧是你啊，庫林。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "羅里的狀態不太對，我跟上去看看……自從他收藏的那些古董在戰爭中被一把火燒了之後，他就一直瘋瘋癲癲的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至於他的刀——他的刀你就收起來吧，庫林，別再還給他了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "庫林，我……唉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "傷口不深，過來，我先幫你止血。糧食的事，等涅梅絲回來，我請她想想辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道……嘶……我知道，你是真的把自己有的都拿出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你也就是看起來兇巴巴的——\n嘶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "少說話，節省力氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "家裡可能還剩一點玉米粉，我去找找。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你拿著，然後我送你回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "庫林，你和提奧還好——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……地上怎麼有血？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "羅里失控砍傷了人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "提奧呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "提奧一早就出去了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……糟了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你——\n唉，算了，沒有人想得到事情會突然變成這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "城裡現在怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到處都在傳是維多利亞人破壞了農業地塊，納斯爾紗已經快失控了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道，你之前幫提奧出了一次頭後就沒人敢欺負他，你才放心讓他到處跑。但這次……不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我現在就去找他——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你的雕像還來得及嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雕像得在夏末節前完工，只剩下一點時間了……\n該死，該死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "提奧的事我會去處理，你就專心做好手中的事吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看見提奧了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "提奧？那個孩子又跑去哪裡偷懶了？庫林太寵他了，你真的應該唸一下他……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "提奧，提奧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個小子闖了什麼禍，讓你急著找他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有看到提奧嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我？我還好，就是太餓了。怎麼了？你剛才說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你來得剛好！涅梅絲，提奧那個小子最近沒有什麼可疑的舉動吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……沒有，他還忙不過來呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，他最好是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "提奧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“守靈人”小姐？你怎麼還在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是——哦，“歌唱家”先生，請問您在這裡做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽聞城中發生了一些混亂，我想看看有沒有什麼自己能做的，結果，唉，無能為力，只聽說糧食短缺是維多利亞人破壞導致。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我唯一一次碰到維多利亞人的軍隊純屬意外，那次還是承蒙您和庫林先生救我出來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有您為我提供的關於守靈人的消息，真的令我受益良多——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，“歌唱家”先生，我實在沒有時間和您敘舊——對了，能請您幫我一個忙嗎？庫林的學徒提奧失蹤了，可以請您幫我找他嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這……我愛莫能助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "城裡人現在提到維多利亞人恨不得扒了他們的皮，你又何苦為了一個維多利亞小孩四處奔波呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，我自己找。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也得提醒您一下，慶功會還有一個多小時就開始了，您不是還要把象徵守靈人祝福的祭器送去會場嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，您也真是……抱歉，我先失陪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那現在……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "涅梅絲，是你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "終於找到你了……城裡到底出了什麼事？"
